WEBVTT

00:00:26.579 --> 00:00:31.621
and I knew that, 21 years before,
just outside this holy city,

00:00:31.621 --> 00:00:33.204
he broke my neck.

00:00:33.746 --> 00:00:36.371
And so, on an overcast morning in January,

00:00:36.412 --> 00:00:37.996
I headed north

00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:39.287
off in a silver Chevy,

00:00:39.287 --> 00:00:41.579
to find a man and some peace.

00:00:42.537 --> 00:00:45.121
The road dropped, and I exited Jerusalem.

00:00:45.121 --> 00:00:48.037
I then rounded the very bend
where his blue truck,

00:00:48.037 --> 00:00:50.329
heavy with four tons of floor tiles,

00:00:50.371 --> 00:00:51.871
had borne down with great speed

00:00:51.912 --> 00:00:55.037
onto the back left corner
of the minibus where I sat.

00:00:56.371 --> 00:00:58.537
I was then 19 years old.

00:00:58.954 --> 00:01:02.537
I'd grown five inches
and done some 20,000 pushups